Tapin wrote:
> I should state (for the record) that I'm certainly not suggesting any
> changes, merely that I had heard  grumblings and felt empathy towards
> patita, who hit Astral six times in order to get two unique deaths.

One of those games fell into the *\(with the amulet\) category.
And together with the 3 other games on astral it were 5 out of 9.
(as expected ;-))

Altoghether I think that for practical purposes the tournament script
works fine, but it somehow discourages trying anything new.

E.g. getting killed by the guardian angel would probably just silently
fall into the category for ordinary angels/minions.
And getting killed by a spellcasting quest nemesis probably just ends up
in the 'killed by.* invisible .*' category...

On the other hand kicking/choking on slime molds is altogether worth 8 
points. 3 for choking on a slime molds with an appropriate name and 5
for kicking them...


